tched once per install.", "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "• A finished season can never change → fetched once per install.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": true}, {"angle": 0, "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "id": "t349", "type": "text", "x": 1520, "y": 983, "width": 423.50000000000006, "height": 35.0, "strokeColor": "#343a40", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "seed": 2871650, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 2879569, "text": "• The next match and the last result never touch disk —\na countdown built on a stale kick-off is the defect.", "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "• The next match and the last result never touch disk —\na countdown built on a stale kick-off is the defect.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": true}, {"angle": 0, "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "id": "t352", "type": "text", "x": 1520, "y": 1041, "width": 423.50000000000006, "height": 52.5, "strokeColor": "#343a40", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "seed": 2895407, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 2903326, "text": "• Freshness stamps live in the database, not in memory:\nan in-memory stamp dies with the process and every\ncold start would re-fetch.", "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "• Freshness stamps live in the database, not in memory:\nan in-memory stamp dies with the process and every\ncold start would re-fetch.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": true}, {"angle": 0, "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "id": "t355", "type": "text", "x": 1520, "y": 1119, "width": 354.20000000000005, "height": 35.0, "strokeColor": "#343a40", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "seed": 2919164, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 2927083, "text": "• One mutex, nothing awaited while it is held;\nconcurrent callers of a key share one load.", "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "• One mutex, nothing awaited while it is held;\nconcurrent callers of a key share one load.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": true}, {"angle": 0, "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "isDeleted": false, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1, "link": null, "locked": false, "id": "t358", "type": "text", "x": 1520, "y": 1197, "width": 454.3, "height": 70.0, "strokeColor": "#868e96", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "seed": 2942921, "version": 1, "versionNonce": 2950840, "text": "Written once in commonMain: every screen, state holder,\nrepository and test. Platform code only where the platforms\ngenuinely differ — HTTP engine, database location, video,\nlogging sink, background scheduling.", "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 2, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "containerId": null, "originalText": "Written once in commonMain: every screen, state holder,\nrepository and test. Platform code only where the platforms\ngenuinely differ — HTTP engine, database location, video,\nlogging sink, background scheduling.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "autoResize": true}], "appState": {"gridSize": null, "viewBackgroundColor": "#ffffff"}, "files": {}}